Retailer "1" -- "0..*" SalesOrder : debtor orders
SalesOrder "1" -- "0..1" Payment : receivable ledger
SalesOrder "1" -- "0..*" ManualPayment : collection attempts
UserAccount "0..1" -- "0..*" Payment : confirms collection
UserAccount "0..1" -- "0..*" ManualPayment : confirms manual payment
SalesOrder "1" -- "0..*" ReceiptDiscrepancy : disputes
Payment "1" -- "0..*" ManualRefund : refund obligations
Payment ..> RetailerReceivableResult : computes balances
ManualPayment ..> ReceivableCollectionHistory : collection history
ReceiptDiscrepancy ..> ReceivableDisputeHistory : dispute history
ManualRefund ..> ReceivableRefundHistory : refund history
RetailerReceivableResult "1" *-- "0..*" ReceivableCollectionHistory : collections
RetailerReceivableResult "1" *-- "0..*" ReceivableDisputeHistory : disputes
RetailerReceivableResult "1" *-- "0..*" ReceivableRefundHistory : refunds
